      "sourceText": "本节点只写输出里程计的位姿，不转传输入速度和协方差，这些字段保持默认零值，不能据此判断车辆静止或估计没有不确定性。",
      "translatedText": "This node only writes the pose of the output odometry and does not forward the input velocity and covariance\\. These fields remain at their default zero values, and this cannot be used to determine that the vehicle is stationary or that there is no uncertainty in the estimate\\.",
